  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Bcr 214.01 How Adopted. Rules to update or change the state building code for the codes described in RSA 155-A:1, IV shall be adopted by order as provided in Bcr 214. Rules shall be proposed by petition or on the board's own initiative.\n\nSource. #8044, eff 2-17-04; ss by #10073, INTERIM, eff 1-17-12, EXPIRES: 7-16-12; ss by #10161, eff 7-13-12",
